rah/18.html\">Sura Al-Kahf</a> › Aya 97</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Kahf 18:97</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَمَا اسْطَاعُوا أَن يَظْهَرُوهُ وَمَا اسْتَطَاعُوا لَهُ نَقْبًا﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dõmin haka bã za su iya hawansa ba, kuma bã zã su iya hujẽwa gare shi ba.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي يعلوا عليه.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 6/208</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s18a97\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/18-79.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (18:79)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/18-101.html\">Aya ta gaba (18:101)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}